    <bpmn:process id="W_W3589" name="W3589. Vendor &amp; Platform Strategy for Enterprise Systems" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Platform/vendor decision; contract renewal; portfolio change (W3577); strategy (W3585)
Frequency: Per decision + strategy refresh
Volume: Enterprise platform/vendor relationships
Owner: Chief Enterprise Architect / Vendor Management
Participants: Chief Enterprise Architect, Vendor Management (links to VS-03/VS-34), CIO, Procurement (links to VS-34), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17.4), IT Leadership, Security (links to VS-27.3)
Source: workflow W3589 — Vendor &amp; Platform Strategy for Enterprise Systems</bpmn:documentation>
