        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-570 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Strategy, Innovation Governance &amp; Architecture Analytics (PA-113.3).) | - operational: exit strategy and portability standards; operational: multi-vendor/fallback and lifecycle monitoring
Owner: Chief Enterprise Architect / Vendor Management</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
