    <bpmn:process id="W_W3591" name="W3591. Enterprise Architecture Stakeholder Engagement &amp; Communication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: EA strategy (W3569); ARB cycle; major change
Frequency: Continuous + per cycle
Volume: Enterprise stakeholders
Owner: Chief Enterprise Architect
Participants: Chief Enterprise Architect, Enterprise Architects, Business Capability Owners, ExCo (links to VS-33), PMO (links to VS-112), IT Leadership, Change Management (links to VS-30.3), Internal Comms (links to VS-103)
Source: workflow W3591 — Enterprise Architecture Stakeholder Engagement &amp; Communication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3591_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3591_Lane1" name="Chief Enterprise Architect">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3591_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3591_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3591_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
