    <bpmn:process id="W_W3592" name="W3592. Architecture Metrics, Portfolio Health &amp; Technology Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; ExCo/board cycle (links to VS-33.2/VS-36)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: EA metrics and portfolio
Owner: Chief Enterprise Architect / BI
Participants: Chief Enterprise Architect, BI (links to VS-28.1), Enterprise Architects, IT Leadership, Finance (links to VS-17.4), PMO (links to VS-112), ExCo (links to VS-33.2)
Source: workflow W3592 — Architecture Metrics, Portfolio Health &amp; Technology Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3592_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3592_Lane1" name="Chief Enterprise Architect">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3592_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3592_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3592_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3592_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3592_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3592_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; ExCo/board cycle (links to VS-33.2/VS-36)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3592_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3592_Task4" name="Chief Enterprise Architect/BI define and instrument EA metrics: standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Chief Enterprise Architect/BI define and instrument EA metrics: standards conformance %, ARB throughput/cycle-time, waiver count/trend (W3573), technical-debt burndown (W3578), portfolio health (W3577), integration health/reuse (W3579), availability/resilience (W3590), TCO/spend (W3588), and value/benefits (links to VS-112/W3561)
Responsible (R): Chief Enterprise Architect / BI
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3592_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3592_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3592_Task5" name="Chief Enterprise Architect/BI produce the architecture and portfolio-health…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Chief Enterprise Architect/BI produce the architecture and portfolio-health dashboards: portfolio composition, spend, technical-debt, risk, rationalization progress, and strategic-roadmap delivery; tailored views per audience (EA/IT Leadership/ExCo/board)
Responsible (R): Chief Enterprise Architect / BI
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3592_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3592_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3592_Task6" name="Chief Enterprise Architect report EA posture, portfolio health, and value to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Chief Enterprise Architect report EA posture, portfolio health, and value to ExCo (links to VS-33.2) and the board (links to VS-36), drive decisions (re-prioritize, invest, retire), and feed metrics to maturity/CI (W3576), strategy (W3585), and audit (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Chief Enterprise Architect
Accountable (A): CIO / CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3592_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3592_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3592_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3592_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3592_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-570 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Strategy, Innovation Governance &amp; Architecture Analytics (PA-113.3).) | - operational: focused, decision-oriented metrics; operational: instrumentation and data discipline
Owner: Chief Enterprise Architect / BI</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3592_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3592_Annotation8" targetRef="W3592_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3592_Flow10" sourceRef="W3592_Start3" targetRef="W3592_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3592_Flow11" sourceRef="W3592_Task4" targetRef="W3592_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3592_Flow12" sourceRef="W3592_Task5" targetRef="W3592_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3592_Flow13" sourceRef="W3592_Task6" targetRef="W3592_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3592_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3592_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3592">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3592_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3592_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
